Don't be there because I can't save you.

01:26:39.750 --> 01:26:41.425
Get ouf ot there, you hear me?

01:26:51.208 --> 01:26:55.592
If I said we can make it,
then I mean it.

01:26:56.208 --> 01:26:57.758
Fuck!

01:26:58.292 --> 01:26:59.842
